        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/mexo/TrajectoryBased"/>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Framework that systematically changes neighborhood structures to escape local optima and intensify search. Reference: Mladenović, N., &amp; Hansen, P. (1997). Variable neighborhood search. Computers &amp; Operations Research, 24, 1097–1100. https://doi.org/10.1016/S0305-0548(97)00031-2</skos:definition>
