        <skos:broader rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/mexo/SwarmIntelligence"/>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Population-based algorithm inspired by humpback whales&apos; bubble-net hunting, combining encircling and spiral updating mechanisms. Reference: Mirjalili, S., &amp; Lewis, A. (2016). The whale optimization algorithm. Advances in Engineering Software, 95, 51–67. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.advengsoft.2016.01.008</skos:definition>
